Comment: 0,0:03:52.00,0:05:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.00,0:03:56.46,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.08,0:04:02.00,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.06,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}才能がないことを知ったって
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}逃げ延びる理由になるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2\fscx66\fscy66\pos(960,1014)}わけ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.03,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}内側に響くこの悲鳴に
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.03,0:04:22.14,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}応えてやれるのは誰だ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.14,0:04:26.04,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}せめて生涯の幾度かは
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.98,0:04:30.78,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}正直な当事者でありたい
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.19,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それが今日だとしたら？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.21,0:04:39.75,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.08,0:04:44.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}でも　気付いたんだろう
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.10,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}躰は止まれない
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.10,0:04:53.35,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「ただ　失い難い貴方を想えば」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.35,0:04:56.97,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「くだらない恐怖だ」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.73,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.26,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}命さえ晒し唄えば
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.58,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.59,0:05:06.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}今に分かることだ
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.62,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.84,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}ここで終わるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.84,0:05:14.08,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それは嫌だろう
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:56.46,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:04:02.00,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.06,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}才能がないことを知ったって
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}逃げ延びる理由になるのか
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1\fscx66\fscy66\pos(960,1014)}わけ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.03,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}内側に響くこの悲鳴に
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:22.14,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}応えてやれるのは誰だ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:26.04,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}せめて生涯の幾度かは
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:30.78,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}正直な当事者でありたい
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.19,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}それが今日だとしたら？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:39.75,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:44.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}でも　気付いたんだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.10,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}躰は止まれない
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:53.35,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}「ただ　失い難い貴方を想えば」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:56.97,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}「くだらない恐怖だ」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.73,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.26,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}命さえ晒し唄えば
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.58,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:06.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}今に分かることだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.62,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.84,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}ここで終わるのか
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:14.08,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}それは嫌だろう
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.00,0:03:56.46,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.08,0:04:02.00,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.06,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己沒有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但這能成為苟且偷生的藉口嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.57,0:04:20.03,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在內心深處響起的悲鳴
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.03,0:04:22.14,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由誰來回應
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.14,0:04:26.04,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那麼幾次
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.98,0:04:30.78,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做個正直的當事者
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.19,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.21,0:04:39.75,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.08,0:04:44.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已經察覺到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.10,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身體已無法停滯不前
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.10,0:04:53.35,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.35,0:04:56.97,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「這點恐懼便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.73,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.38,0:05:01.26,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放聲高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.58,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.59,0:05:06.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知曉
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.62,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.49,0:05:10.84,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在這裡結束嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.84,0:05:14.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}這絕非你所願吧
